# SECTION 1: LUXURY DESIGN SYSTEM, VISUAL IDENTITY & SPATIAL GRID

### 1.1 Brand Essence & Design Philosophy
* **Brand Name:** Atelier AI (Maison de Haute Couture & Studio de Création Artificielle)
* **Design Philosophy:** "Architectural Restraint Meets Digital Couture." Every viewport leverages balanced proportions, eliminating barren dead spaces while preserving high-fashion editorial breathing room.
* **Content Density Principle:** High informational value per square inch without visual clutter. Text blocks are accompanied by structured metadata, badges, garment specifications, and micro-interactions.

### 1.2 Layout Grids & Spatial Rhythms
* **Desktop (1440px – 1920px Canvas):**
  * Grid: 12-Column Flexible Grid | 64px Side Margins | 20px Gutter | Max content container: 1360px.
  * Spatial Rhythm: Base unit of 4px. Component spacing scales across `8px`, `12px`, `16px`, `24px`, `32px`, `48px`, and `64px`.
* **Tablet (768px – 1024px Canvas):**
  * Grid: 8-Column Grid | 24px Side Margins | 16px Gutter.
* **Mobile (375px – 430px Canvas):**
  * Grid: 4-Column Grid | 16px Side Margins | 12px Gutter | Full-bleed interactive carousels with peek previews.

### 1.3 Color Palette & Material Surfaces
| Token Name | Hex Code | Visual Application & Hierarchy |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Alabaster Canvas** | `#FAF9F6` | Primary background; warm ivory softening eye fatigue and evoking archival cotton paper. |
| **Pure Surface** | `#FFFFFF` | Card containers, flyout panels, modal drawers, and sticky decision cards. |
| **Deep Obsidian** | `#111317` | High-contrast typography, primary buttons, borders, and footer backdrop. |
| **Muted Slate** | `#4B5563` | Secondary text, textile yarn descriptions, care protocols, and breadcrumbs. |
| **Hairline Neutral** | `#E5E7EB` | Ultra-fine structural dividers (1px solid borders) replacing harsh shadows. |
| **Champagne Gold** | `#C5A880` | AI Custom Studio accents, VIP badges, selection rings, and rating stars. |
| **Soft Sage** | `#DDE6CE` | Ecological/sustainable fabric badges, organic certifications, and in-stock badges. |
| **Rich Amber** | `#D97706` | Low-stock counters, tailoring feasibility alerts, and time-sensitive offers. |
| **Crimson Silk** | `#DC2626` | Form validation errors, sold-out tags, and critical notices. |

### 1.4 Typography Hierarchy (Pairing: Serif Editorial + Sans Precision)
* **Editorial Serif (Playfair Display / Cormorant Garamond):**
  * `Display Hero H1`: 52px – 60px | Semi-Bold | Line-height 1.15 | Tracking: -0.02em
  * `Page Title H2`: 32px – 38px | Semi-Bold | Line-height 1.25 | Tracking: -0.01em
  * `Section Header H3`: 22px – 26px | Medium | Line-height 1.30
* **Functional Sans-Serif (Inter / Plus Jakarta Sans):**
  * `UI Subhead / Card Title`: 15px – 16px | Medium (500) | Line-height 1.4
  * `Body Regular`: 14px | Regular (400) | Line-height 1.6
  * `Technical Specs / Meta Data`: 12px – 13px | Regular (400) | Monospace/Sans | Line-height 1.5
  * `Badges / Action Buttons`: 11px – 13px | Bold (600) | All-Caps | Tracking: +0.06em
  * `Price Display`: 16px – 20px | Bold (700) | Tabular figures

